B.bpZ=s(["The brain, spine, and heart have begun to form.","By the end of the week the heart will be pumping blood.","Week 5 is the beginning of the embryonic period, which lasts from the 5th to the 10th week.","It is during this critical period that many birth defects occur in the developing embryo. Most of these birth defects will have no known cause or will be due to a combination of factors (multifactorial)."],t.s)
