B.bBL=s(["The fetus can respond to sounds that occur in the mother's surroundings. Its eyelids can open and close.","The average fetus at 26 weeks is 13.8 inches (35.1 cm) long and weighs about 2 pounds (913 grams).","Survival out of the womb at this age would be expected to be approximately 87%."],t.s)
