B.bxG=s(["The fetus has eyelashes and its skin is red and covered with vernix caseosa, a waxy substance believed to act as a protective film with anti-infective and waterproofing properties.","The average fetus at 28 weeks is 14.9 inches (37.9 cm) long and weighs 2.7 pounds (1210 grams).",u.bs],t.s)
